{"3461240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pure Domino", "steam_appid": 3461240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What would happen if we take a simple game of domino…. And over-engineer the heck out of it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That is the premise of Pure Domino, make it as close as possible to how people play on a table, with shuffling tiles and multiplayer where all actions are being seen by other players like they are in the same room. The kind of game where you have your snacks and drinks on the side and play with friends or strangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Single Player for Practice</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the ropes and train yourself to when you face others online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Multiplayer</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 to 4 players in a match.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player will host the game (becomes the server).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create matches with the max score, multipliers, number of players, game type, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LAN Support,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online via Steam.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Game Types</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic Domino</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross Domino</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chicken Foot (In Progress)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mexican Train</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Customization</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the table and tiles you will use on your end when playing the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Widescreen Support</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16:9 and 32:9 Aspect ratios supported in both Windowed and Full-Screen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Additional Notes:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please check the community hub about the ports the game uses so you can set up on your router/firewalls</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What would happen if we take a simple game of domino…. And over-engineer the heck out of it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That is the premise of Pure Domino, make it as close as possible to how people play on a table, with shuffling tiles and multiplayer where all actions are being seen by other players like they are in the same room. The kind of game where you have your snacks and drinks on the side and play with friends or strangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Single Player for Practice</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the ropes and train yourself to when you face others online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Multiplayer</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 to 4 players in a match.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player will host the game (becomes the server).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create matches with the max score, multipliers, number of players, game type, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LAN Support,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online via Steam.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Game Types</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic Domino</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross Domino</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chicken Foot (In Progress)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mexican Train</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Customization</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the table and tiles you will use on your end when playing the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Widescreen Support</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16:9 and 32:9 Aspect ratios supported in both Windowed and Full-Screen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Additional Notes:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please check the community hub about the ports the game uses so you can set up on your router/firewalls</p>", "short_description": "A 3d Domino online game where players can experience a game like they are playing physically in the same room.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461240/01b5609e9c0a7e4e8dc3e22931df8247d800ae76/header.jpg?t=1783322902", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461240/101409815d4d5dbed2ca400906c8a4557d4643a5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783322902", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461240/101409815d4d5dbed2ca400906c8a4557d4643a5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783322902", "website": "https://www.indiedb.com/games/multi-dominoes-remake-tentative", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/10/11<br></l